| `make fmt-sh` `[tree]` | Rewrites every shell script in place with the formatter `shell.formatter` names, through `scripts/shell_gate.py`. | `make fmt-sh` | [`shell.enabled`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`shell.excluded_paths`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`shell.no_scripts`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`shell.formatter`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`shell.script_suffixes`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`shell.shebang_shells`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Writes the tree; the gate runs `make fmt-check-sh` instead. The same exit 11 and stated passes as `make lint-sh`. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
